5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Hello everyone. We need to determine the purpose of the break room. To avoid making a decision based on mere impressions, we should first examine the actual usage data and the physical constraints of the space.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree, Ryuji. It would be wise to start with a clear understanding of how the room is currently used. A calm approach will help us find a solution that brings peace to everyone.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I'm totally on board! Let's make sure we don't just pick something that looks good on paper but ends up being a total drag to actually maintain. I want this to be a win for everyone!,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's not get too carried away with ""wins"" and ""peace"" just yet. We need the cold, hard facts first. I'm interested in seeing the actual costs and the frequency of our failures.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be here with you all. Let us approach this with patience and an open heart. A space that serves us well is one where every voice is heard and respected.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I will look into the ""Fortnight's tally of use by person"" and ""Crumbs and bins at the desks."" We need to see who is actually using the space and who is bearing the burden of cleaning.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe it is important to understand the social dynamics of the room. I will look into ""Unplanned talk since the refit"" and ""Where the last awkward conversation happened"" to see how we truly interact.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"I'll check the ""Invoices for outside hire by the hour"" and ""Round trip for a hot lunch""! I want to see where our time is actually going so we don't end up with a total time-sink!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll take the ""Quotes for the two fit-outs"" and ""Facilities callouts on this floor."" If we're going to change the room's purpose, I want to see the actual price tags and the history of things breaking.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"I shall look into ""The partition wall to the office"" and ""Crumbs and bins at the desks."" It is often the smallest details, like a stray crumb or a thin wall, that weigh most heavily on the spirit.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Since Servas is also checking the cleaning habits, we can compare our findings later. I want to see if there is a correlation between the frequency of use and the amount of mess left behind.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a thoughtful idea, Ryuji. While you focus on the physical traces, I hope to understand the emotional ones. Perhaps the way we use the space reflects the things we leave unsaid.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"@Jonathan, you're always so deep! But while you're hunting for ""unsaid things,"" I'll be hunting for lost hours. I just hope we don't find out we're spending half our day just walking around!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, hunting for ""lost hours"" is a start, but it's the money that usually leaves the biggest mark. I'm more interested in whether we're paying for a room that's essentially a glorified storage closet.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It is a joy to see such diverse perspectives. Whether we seek financial clarity or emotional harmony, we are all searching for the same thing: a place where we can truly belong and find peace.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I believe we have a comprehensive plan. By analyzing usage patterns, costs, and physical maintenance, we can reach a rational conclusion. I will proceed with my research and see you all in the next round.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. Let us each reflect on what we find in the quiet of our research. I look forward to hearing your discoveries and finding a path that brings us all a sense of serenity.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,I'm ready to dive in! I'll be the one keeping things lively while we hunt for clues. Let's just make sure we're honest about the effort involved. See you all soon with the results!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll be the one to keep us grounded. While you all chase serenity and ""clues,"" I'll be looking at the numbers. Let's see if the reality matches the optimism. See you in the next round.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,"I shall now begin my research. Let us remember that the truth often reveals itself in the quietest corners. I look forward to sharing what I find with you all. Until then, be well.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
