34,2,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The data reveals a significant imbalance. Only two people are using the room frequently, yet the mess—specifically crumbs and overflowing bins—has spread to the office desks. It is clear that the lack of a defined purpose is creating a maintenance burden.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It seems we are indeed drifting apart. I found that our only spontaneous interactions now happen by the printer, and some of us remain strangers. We lack a sanctuary for the conversations that truly matter.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"Wow, you guys are so gloomy! But look at this: we're spending a fortune on outside room hires for tiny groups, and we're wasting nearly an hour a day just trekking for hot lunch! We're literally throwing time and money away!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, you're finally talking sense. I found that fit-outs aren't cheap—we're looking at either 141,000 or 96,000 yen. Plus, the facilities logs show this floor is a magnet for callouts. We can't just ""wish"" a solution into existence.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a reminder that the physical world speaks to us in whispers. I found that the wall is but a thin veil, allowing every word to drift into the office, and the crumbs have found their way to our desks.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Servas, your findings confirm mine. The crumbs are not just a nuisance; they are a symptom of a system where no one is responsible. If the room is used without rules, the burden falls on those who care most.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, responsibility is important, but I worry more about the silence between us. I discovered that the last difficult conversation we had was conducted in public, leaving a lingering tension that lasted for weeks.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Jonathan, that sounds like a total nightmare! But seriously, if we're spending 25 minutes just to get lunch, we're exhausted before we even start. We need a space that actually saves us time, not adds to the chore list!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, saving time is great, but let's look at the price of that convenience. We're talking about nearly a hundred thousand yen just for a fridge and a hob. I'm wondering who's actually signing the check for these ""time-savers.""","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"It is a delicate balance, is it not? We seek the comfort of a warm meal and the ease of proximity, yet we must be mindful of the cost. Let us not let the price tag overshadow the value of our peace.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, the cost is a factor, but the current lack of structure is already costing us in terms of hygiene and fairness. We cannot justify a high-cost fit-out if it only benefits the two most frequent users.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, I understand your concern for fairness. However, if we only focus on the frequency of use, we might overlook the quality of our connections. A room that allows for private, honest dialogue could heal the tensions that public spaces only amplify.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"@Jonathan, healing tensions is sweet, but I'm thinking about the actual grind! If we're spending 68,000 yen on outside hires and hours walking for food, we're just paying to be tired. Let's find a way to stop the leak!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, ""stopping the leak"" is a nice phrase, but you're ignoring the new leak we'd be creating. Spending 100k on a kitchen just to save a few walks for lunch seems like a poor trade-off. We need a solution that actually pays for itself.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"My dear friends, let us remember that the most expensive cost is often the one we cannot see. A thin wall that carries every whisper and crumbs that invade our workspace are burdens on the soul. Peace is a priceless investment.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"We must move beyond abstract concepts like ""peace"" and ""soul."" The data shows a clear pattern of misuse and an unfair distribution of labor. Any solution we choose must include a formal agreement on usage and cleaning to prevent further resentment.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe a formal agreement is a start, Ryuji, but rules cannot replace a safe space. If we only solve the hygiene, we remain strangers who fear difficult conversations. We need a room that fosters both respect and genuine connection.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, @Jonathan, you're both so serious! Rules and ""safe spaces"" are fine, but let's be real: if we don't fix the time-sink, we'll be too grumpy to follow any rules or connect with anyone! We need a practical win!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, your ""practical win"" is just a fancy way of saying ""spend money we might not have."" Let's be honest: we're currently paying for a room that fails us. I want to see the actual figures before we commit to another expensive mistake.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,"It is natural for us to feel the tension between the heart's desire and the mind's caution. Let us carry this wisdom into the next stage, seeking a path that honors both our budget and our well-being.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
56,3,,status,May,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
